# Custom Categories Configuration for renAI
#
# File Format:
# - Lines starting with '#' are comments
# - Empty lines are ignored
# - Use 'LANG: language_code' to specify language (tr for Turkish, en for English)
# - Categories are listed under their respective language
#
# Example:
# LANG: en
# Article
# Fiction
# Non-Fiction
# Textbook

# English Categories
LANG: en
Article
Fiction
Non-Fiction
Textbook
Report
Gov
Presentation
Manual
Thesis
Research
Other
Dictionary
Biography
Memoir
Science
History
Philosophy
Psychology
Economics
Technology
Programming
Cooking
Travel
Health
Self-Help

# Turkish Categories
LANG: tr
Makale
Kurgu
